        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset HFLRDT Halifax Door Levers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Kwikset Halifax door levers have a contemporary design with a unique shape that is ultra sleek making it an excellent choice for those who like a more minimalistic look. The Halifax is a non-handed lever which makes this item easy to install.  Fits most pre-drilled doors since it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" for door 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick. Available in dummy, passage, privacy and key entry functions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/halifax-square-lever-set-kwikset-hflsqt\"><b>Halifax Square Door Lever</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Halifax Door Lever Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick SmartKey system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed levers.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kwikset Halifax Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-15/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive lever for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational lever is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Pushbutton on interior rose engages privacy lock on both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Halifax Door Lever Set, Kwikset HFLRDT",
                "description": "Kwikset HFLRDT - The Kwikset Halifax door levers have a contemporary design with a unique shape that is ultra sleek making it an excellent choice for those who like a more minimalistic look. The Halifax is a non-handed lever which makes this item easy to install. Fits most pre-drilled doors since it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for door 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick. Available in dummy, passage, privacy and key entry functions.",
